title: "GPPVerify: Lean 4 formalization of shadow holography (Golden Physics Project)"
abstract: "A Lean 4 + Mathlib library of kernel-checked theorems formalizing the shadow-holography framework of the Golden Physics Project, with every open step named as an explicit open_ stub and zero custom axioms."
